      "value": "33 admins · $49.0M capital at risk",
      "summary": "Aave V3 is a multi-pool overcollateralised lending market on Ethereum with four parallel deployments — Main, Lido, Prime/EtherFi, and Horizon RWA — each with its own Pool/PoolConfigurator/ACLManager triplet and a shared Aave Governance V3 root. Borrowers deposit collateral (ATokens) against which they take variable-rate debt (VariableDebtTokens), with valuations driven by Chainlink primary feeds and Aave-deployed CAPO adapters that bound liquid-staking and yield-bearing collateral ratios. The protocol is upgradeable: all pool implementations sit behind InitializableImmutableAdminUpgradeabilityProxies whose immutable admin is the PoolAddressesProvider, itself controlled by the on-chain gover…",
